Delivered revenue =
CALCULATE(
    SUM(sales_lines[line_value]),
    USERELATIONSHIP(sales_lines[delivered_date], dates[date])
)

// D18 · lab 04 · a prepared measure (D19 teaches how measures are written).
// Copy from "Delivered revenue =" to the closing bracket above, not these comment lines.
// It adds up line_value using the inactive relationship dates[date] → sales_lines[delivered_date]
// instead of the active one to order_date. The relationship must exist (the dashed line in Model view).
